# Connect (plumbing only)

Poll `GET https://api.github.com/events` with `GITHUB_TOKEN`, a non-empty `User-Agent`, and `Accept: application/vnd.github+json`.

- Explode the JSON **array** into one message per event before filter.
- Keep `PullRequestEvent` where `payload.action` is in an allowlist (`opened` only for v1).
- Project the work-topic schema in `.cursor/spec/architecture.md`. One Bloblang mapping; `mapping` rebuilds `root`.
- Cache on GitHub event `id`. Produce `github.pr.opened`.
- Never call Ollama / OpenAI from Connect.

```bloblang
# ❌ BAD — one field drops the rest
root.event_id = this.id

# ✅ GOOD
root.event_id = this.id
root.repo = this.repo.name
root.pr_number = this.payload.pull_request.number
root.action = this.payload.action
```

Details: `.cursor/spec/architecture.md` (Connect section).
